    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off with your friends in a fresh local multiplayer frenzy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sky-High Sword Stunts!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035660/extras/9c7aea29802e0d36b6f4a5bd97eba78f.poster.avif?t=1732125616\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035660/extras/9c7aea29802e0d36b6f4a5bd97eba78f.webm?t=1732125616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035660/extras/9c7aea29802e0d36b6f4a5bd97eba78f.mp4?t=1732125616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing your sword with precise timing to leap great distances</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deflect Bullets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035660/extras/7a99ba5425b9ecbabaf7fd6d734f9c64.poster.avif?t=1732125616\" width=300 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035660/extras/7a99ba5425b9ecbabaf7fd6d734f9c64.webm?t=1732125616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035660/extras/7a99ba5425b9ecbabaf7fd6d734f9c64.mp4?t=1732125616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's easy to shoot, but a clever opponent can send your bullets right back to you</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's Showdown Time!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035660/extras/792115735063ad1f9f446f40a26bae24.poster.avif?t=1732125616\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035660/extras/792115735063ad1f9f446f40a26bae24.webm?t=1732125616\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035660/extras/792115735063ad1f9f446f40a26bae24.mp4?t=1732125616\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the strongest settle it at sunset</p>",
